Here's a step-by-step solution:

1. Create an adjacency list representation of the graph.
2. For each section of the graph, if there are different flow values \(E_{ii}^1\) and \(E_{ii}^{i}\) for all nodes on odd-weight, form a "faulty" connection or vice versa.
