5. Ensure the algorithm returns the minimal expected path from any state of the graph to the other state, which will give us the largest \(E_{jj}^1\) or \(E_{jj}^{j+1}\).
6. Check if \(E_{ii}^1 = 2 \times E_{ii}^2\) (it's directed among each pair of opposite face edges (forward-on) -> opposite face edges (backward-off)).
